---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions · BCQStudios" description="Terms for the BCQStudios site and studio work.">
	<h1 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms & Conditions.</h1>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		These terms cover this site and work with Brendan Callanan trading as BCQStudios. An engagement
		can set different terms in writing. If it does, those win.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Site</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		This site describes the studio. It is not a quote or a contract.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Work</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		Work starts when we both agree the scope, fee, and timing in writing. Email is enough. Until
		then, conversations are exploratory.
	</p>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		We deliver a working slice you can put in front of people, not a production system, SLA, or
		ongoing support, unless we agree otherwise.
	</p>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		Invoices are due as written. Unpaid or expanding work can pause until we reset the agreement.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Ownership</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		You keep what you already own and grant us a licence to use what you send so we can do the
		work. On full payment, you own the deliverables we make for you, except tools, libraries, and
		patterns we already use or reuse. We may mention the engagement unless you ask us not to.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Limits</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		A prototype is not warranted for production use. Our liability for an engagement is limited to
		the fees you paid for it. We are not liable for indirect or consequential loss. Irish law
		applies.
	</p>
	<h2 class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Changes</h2>
	<p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
		We may update these terms. An active engagement keeps what we agreed in writing.
	</p>
	<p class="mt-12 text-sm text-muted-foreground/60">Last updated 17 September 2026</p>
	<p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">
		<a href="/" class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline">
			Back to the studio
		</a>
	</p>
</Layout>
